    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Launch.Memory.Warning.Java32Bit">32-bit Java can use only about 1 GB of memory. Use a 64-bit Java runtime instead.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Launch.Memory.Warning.TooMuch">Too much memory is allocated to Minecraft and may cause crashes. Try Automatic first.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Launch.MsAuth.DeviceCode">Device Code</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Launch.MsAuth.Label">Microsoft sign-in method</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Launch.MsAuth.ToolTip">Web Account Manager provides the simplest sign-in experience. Device Code lets you complete sign-in in any browser and is preferable on a shared or public computer.&#x0a;Use Device Code if Web Account Manager doesn’t work. This setting is temporarily locked to Device Code because of dependency issues.</sys:String>
